# (its dictionary occasionally flags legitimate technical terms/identifiers
# as typos) -- this couldn't be pre-populated since codespell has never
# actually been run against this repo; the first CI run is what will reveal
# whether anything needs adding here. Example:
# ignore-words-list = word1,word2
